  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Nordhavn Overview Buy Ella Mae Pilot Crew Ferry Models Pilot Crew Ferry Company About Team Investors Careers Media News Events Owners Service Charging Customer stories Contact A better way to build boats for working water Nordhavn designs and builds electric workboats in one yard in Rotterdam. Hulls, battery packs and the software that runs them come from the same team, so a pilot station, wind farm or ferry operator gets one boat, one warranty and one number to call. Since 2016 we have delivered 64 boats to ports, offshore wind farms and cities around the North Sea. Every one of them is still in service, and every one of them charges at the quay between jobs instead of burning diesel while it waits. Investor relations Careers Latest news The Nordhavn method We build one platform in three lengths. The hull, the battery bay and the wheelhouse share their parts, so a Ferry is fitted out by the same people, with the same tools, as a Pilot. That keeps the yard quick and the spares list short. The battery bay Packs assembled and tested in our own workshop One yard, every hull Welded, fitted and launched at Waalhaven Designed around the crew, built for the quay The helm O",
